OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after e-bike      
OL,4,Acauses house fire                      
OL,6,FA lithium-ion battery warning has been 
OL,7,Fissued after a fire at a home in Derby.
OL,9,FFirefighters from three Derby stations 
OL,10,Fwere called to a two-storey property on
OL,11,FPeel Street at about 07:20 GMT on 14   
OL,12,FNovember.                              
OL,14,FThe rented property was fitted with    
OL,15,Fsprinklers which activated and         
OL,16,Fcontained the blaze to the room it     
OL,17,Fbroke out in, allowing four people to  
OL,18,Fevacuate safely, the fire service said.
