OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after e-bike      
OL,4,Acauses house fire                      
OL,6,FAn investigation has since found the   
OL,7,Fcause was an e-bike which had been left
OL,8,Fon charge leading to a warning from    
OL,9,Ffirefighters.                          
